// Two expressions at the root: the last is the run target, and the one before
// it, standing before another root form, is a stray, refused where it stands.
// Its twin, `module-linker-late-run-target.gandr`, puts a definition after
// the stray.

/// The first expression, a stray.
@[ refuses("OutOfFragment.WrongSort.declaration") ]
1;

/// The second, the run target.
@[ runs("2") ]
2
